*3 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Celeboodle]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*2 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>, delay 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Celeboodle]] spawns after 56 seconds<sup>1,680f</sup>.
*2 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Strong Single Attackers like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] and [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]] far outrange every threat here, so just be sure to meatshield well. Furthermore, [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] completely demolishes Shy Boy.

